This project is an independent development. It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by,
sponsored by or supported by 1C Company.

The library depends only on the Python standard library. The optional MCP server extra
(elemctl[mcp]) uses the "mcp" package (MIT). Platform credentials are issued by the
platform to its own users and are not redistributed by this project.

The documentation site carries the Cyrillic subsets of the Inter, Inter Tight and Geist
Mono webfonts (site/public/fonts): the build downloads the Latin subset of them only, so
without these files Russian pages would fall back to Arial and Courier New. The fonts
are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 - the license texts lie next to them.
